
## Problem: Finds the average temperature in NYC during June 2020 
## Answer: The average temperature was 72.88 


SELECT EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date) AS month, AVG(temperature) AS temp
FROM `velvety-glazing-468219-t9.demos.nyc_weather` 
WHERE 
  CAST(EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date) AS int64) = 6
GROUP BY 
  month
